<view class="container"><text class="title">旧测试报名进度</text><view class="card"><text class="label">旧版本人查询码</text><input value="{{token}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="64" placeholder="请输入提交成功后获得的查询码"/><text class="muted">仅查询升级前未绑定微信的测试记录。新报名请前往首页的“我的报名”。</text><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="query">查询进度</button><button bindtap="clear">清除本机查询码</button><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{result}}" class="card"><text class="status">{{result.statusText}}</text><text class="muted">记录编号：{{result.id}}</text><text class="muted">提交时间：{{result.createdAt}}</text></view></view>
